\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. A charge to keep I have,
\par A God to glorify,
\par A never-dying soul to save,
\par And fit it for the sky:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. To serve the present age,
\par My calling to fulfil:
\par O may it all my powers engage
\par To do my Master's will!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Arm me with jealous care,
\par As in Thy sight to live;
\par And O Thy servant, Lord, prepare
\par A strict account to give!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Help me to watch and pray,
\par And on Thyself rely,
\par Assured, if I my trust betray,
\par I shall for ever die.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

